{"ref":"BDB, מָכוֹן","hw":"מָכוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָכוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8\" href=\"/Daniel.8\">Dn 8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11\" href=\"/Daniel.11\">11</a> <strong>fixed</strong> or <strong>established place, foundation</strong> (chiefly poet.);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:17\" href=\"/Exodus.15.17\">Ex 15:17</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְכוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:39\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.39\">1 K 8:39</a> + 10 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְכוֹנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְכוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:68\" href=\"/Ezra.2.68\">Ezr 2:68</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְכוֹנֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:5\" href=\"/Psalms.104.5\">ψ 104:5</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>fixed place</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s abode on earth <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:17\" href=\"/Exodus.15.17\">Ex 15:17</a> (song), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.13\">1 K 8:13</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.2\">2 Ch 6:2</a> (poet. fragm.: v. 𝔊 and Dr<sup>Intr. 182</sup>); = <em>place</em>, or <em>site</em> of God’s house <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:68\" href=\"/Ezra.2.68\">Ezr 2:68</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־מְכוֹן הַר־צִיּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.5\">Is 4:5</a>, appar. = <em>all the extent</em> of Mt. Zion; redund. (si vera l.) <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהֻשְׁלַךְ מְכוֹן מִקְדָּשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:11\" href=\"/Daniel.8.11\">Dn 8:11</a> <em>and the place of his sanctuary shall be thrown down</em> (on difficulties of v., see Bev); of heavens <span dir=\"rtl\">מְכוֹן שִׁבְתְּךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:39\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.39\">1 K 8:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:43\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.43\">43</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.49\">49</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:30\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.30\">2 Ch 6:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:33\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:39\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.39\">39</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:14\" href=\"/Psalms.33.14\">ψ 33:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְכוֹנִי</span> alone <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a>; fig. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶדֶק וּמִשְׁפָּט מְכוֹן כִּסְאֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:15\" href=\"/Psalms.89.15\">ψ 89:15</a>, so <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:2\" href=\"/Psalms.97.2\">97:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>foundation</em>, only pl., poet. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָסַד אֶרֶץ עַל־מְכוֹנֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:5\" href=\"/Psalms.104.5\">ψ 104:5</a>.","next":"BDB, מְכוֹנָה","prev":"BDB, יְכוֹנְיָה²"}